{
  "url": "https://www.questrade.com/api/documentation/error-handling",
  "title": "Error handling",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "id": "error-format",
      "text": "Error format"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In case of not being able to successfully service a request the API will return an error response."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The API offers two categories of errors:"
    },
    {
      "type": "listItem",
      "text": "General Error – errors that do NOT result in creation of an order with an internal identifier."
    },
    {
      "type": "listItem",
      "text": "Order Processing Error – errors that occur during processing of trade calls (e.g., placing, replacing, canceling an order) that result in an order being created in the platform."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "id": "general-error-response",
      "text": "General error response"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "General error message will consist of properties specified in the table below."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "caption": "General error response",
      "columns": [
        "Property",
        "Type",
        "Description"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "cells": [
            "code",
            "String",
            "Error code."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "message",
            "String",
            "Error description."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "text": "Sample"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "Plain text",
      "text": "HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request\n  Content-Length: 63\n  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8\n  Date: Fri, 18 Aug 2014 22:17:16 GMT \n      {\n          \"code\": 3139 ,\n           \"message\": \"Invalid route\" \n      }"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "id": "order-processing-error-response",
      "text": "Order processing error response"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Whenever a trading call results in the creation of an order with a unique internal identifier, the platform will return an error response with additional properties (orderId and orders) in addition to standard error fields (code and message) in the response."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "caption": "Order processing error response",
      "columns": [
        "Property",
        "Type",
        "Description"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "cells": [
            "code",
            "String",
            "Error code."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "message",
            "String",
            "Error description."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "orderId",
            "Integer",
            "Internal unique identifier assigned to the order"
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "orders",
            "Complex",
            "List of Order records"
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "orders",
            "Complex",
            "See Order record in the above sections of this document"
          ],
          "level": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "text": "Sample order error response (no order created)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "Plain text",
      "text": "HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request\n  Content-Length: 63\n  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8\n  Date: Fri, 18 Aug 2014 22:17:16 GMT\n      {\n           \"code\": 3139,\n           \"message\": \"Invalid route\"\n      }"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "text": "Sample order error response (order created)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "Plain text",
